				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 08 Jan 2015 14:19:40 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Amo387</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1731153</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I am greatly enjoying seeing an in-character retelling of the early days of the wiki. +1s for everything so far, and I expect it to continue.</p> <p>Re: 682 plushie - Nothing wrong with that. I'd be worried if y'all wanted an actual 682. <em>Then</em> I'd think you have mental problems. =P</p> <p>Just wanted to point out after a few entries now that the Russian guy's name keeps changing here and there. See it as Strelkinov on the main page, but keep seeing that and Strelnikov used in the stories. Not sure if it's somehow intended to be that way and we find out why later (just because it's <em>this</em> wiki, that seems like a possibility lol), or if it's just an oversight.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
